{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And they will listen to your voice.</b> Once you say this language to them, they will listen to your voice — for this sign is already in their hand from Jacob and from Joseph, that with this language they are redeemed. Jacob said to them: ״וֵאלֹהִים פָּקֹד יִפְקֹד אֶתְכֶם״ (Genesis 50); Joseph said to them: ״פָּקֹד יִפְקֹד אֱלֹהִים אֶתְכֶם״ (ibid.)." "<b>Has happened upon us.</b> A term of מִקְרֶה; and likewise ״וַיִּקָּר אֱלֹהִים״, ״וְאָנֹכִי אִקָּרֶה כֹּה״ (Numbers 23) — I will be encountered by Him here."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:24.194055042Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}